    "pokemon": "castform",
    "tint": "#6c8aa6",
    "effect": "none"
   },
   "intro": "The last stair opens onto a round room full of glass and brass. At the centre, among a hundred needles, a woman sits on the floor with her head in her hands.\n\n**Forecaster, Nimbus Hart:** \"I seeded a cloud. One. And now this. It's mine. I have to stop it.\"\n\n*Castform trots across to the instruments and cycles through all four forms in front of them: rain, sun, snow, fog. The needles shiver, and settle.*\n\n**Nimbus:** \"...It isn't mine. It was coming anyway. Oh. Oh, thank goodness. Oh, that's worse.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "\"It'll pass.\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "**Nimbus:** \"Yes. Yes, it will. It's a front. You read a front. You don't stop it.\" She laughs, wetly, for the first time in days.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "join",
        "shadow": false,
        "species": [
         "castform"
        ],
        "types": [],
        "levelBonus": -1,
        "shinyMultiplier": 1,
        "ability": "forecast-ahead",
        "mark": "ws-castform"
       },
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "ws-done",
        "amount": 1
       },
       {
        "kind": "moment",
        "text": "Read a storm with a Castform instead of stopping it. It asked to see real weather.",
        "importance": 55
       },
       {
        "kind": "leavePseudo"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "\"You couldn't have known.\"",
     "success": {
      "text": "She looks up at you for a long time. Then she nods, once, the way people nod when they have been given something they didn't expect.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "attribute",
        "key": "goodEvil",
        "amount": 1
       },
